<title>PHILIPPINES: Digitel 1996 net up at 702.5 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Digitel 1996 net up at 702.5 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   0.14 vs 0.04</p>
